    "title": "Akron man pleads guilty in 2016 shooting that led to victim's death 9 years later - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cliff Pinckard, cleveland.com ,\n1 days ago AKRON, Ohio — An Akron man pleaded guilty to an involuntary manslaughter charge in connection with a shooting in which the victim died nine years later. Summit County Common Pleas Court records show Damon’te Sherrod, 25, agreed to a plea deal Monday. Sherrod was scheduled to go to trial Wednesday for the 2016 shooting death of Mario Harris. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
